usage: fuzz_matrix.py [-h] --old OLD --new NEW
                      [--qualified-head QUALIFIED_HEAD] [--evidence EVIDENCE]
                      [--jobs {1,2}]

Run S3-X's fresh strict nine-kind x 200-case matrix with at most two workers.
Run only after qualification of the final integrated source and both explicit
oracles. Launch the matrix through scripts/build-slot.sh gate; every worker
also obtains a build slot. This driver never builds the compiler or runs
gates.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --old OLD             Explicit qualified old oracle
  --new NEW             Explicit qualified final integrated new oracle
  --qualified-head QUALIFIED_HEAD
                        Require this full qualified source commit to remain
                        HEAD
  --evidence EVIDENCE   Fresh directory below experiments; default is a unique
                        UTC/UUID run
  --jobs {1,2}
